From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:28:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] string: add lazy ConsString rope for concat_owned and pointer
 fast path in PartialEq

Repeated string concatenation (s += chunk) previously copied the entire
accumulated string on every step (O(N^2)). Add a self-flattening binary
ConsString vtable variant for JsString::concat_owned above 64 code units,
with iterative flattening and iterative drop to avoid stack overflow on
deep chains.

Also fast-path JsString::eq with pointer equality and vtable length checks
before vtable dispatch or flattening.
